WEBVTT

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.100
What do you want?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.520
Lord Sesshomaru…

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.360
We shall have your fang.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:13.360
Fang?

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.270
That isn't the one.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:55.280
That sword has no
feeling of destruction.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.110
Go and find the right one.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:11.880
The powerful sword which can
break this seal… Tetsusaiga.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.090
Gramps!

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.560
Breakfast!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.060
Gramps, breakfast!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.810
Oh, Sota!

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.390
Look!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.460
The flower buds are growing!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:38.110
I see them! They're amazing!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:43.120
It's been 500 years since
this sacred tree bloomed!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:49.290
Now then, Sota, the origin
of this sacred tree is…

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.380
Kagome, your soup will get cold.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:54.270
Mom, where's the sugar?

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.610
By the window.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.750
Oh, here.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.780
You sure you don't
need any help?

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.130
Nope. Omelets are my specialty.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.840
Don't overheat the frying pan.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.510
I know! I know!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.310
Shucks! Forgot to oil the pan!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.400
Until then,
the ancient sacred tree

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:14.270
would blossom every
year at this time.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.460
However, after this evil

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.230
half-demon was
sealed to the tree,

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:22.190
not once have
there been flowers.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.890
How's that? Learned something?

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.020
So the flowers bloom again…

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:29.770
because I released
Inuyasha from the seal?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:30.410
Ow!

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.250
Hurray for me!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.010
Done!

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.380
Looks delicious!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.800
Doesn't it?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.550
You're terrific, Sis!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:42.740
Can't have any.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.090
Stingy!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.050
Sota, you're becoming
a nuisance lately!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.950
My name is Kagome Higurashi.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.830
Until just recently,
I was an average ninth-grader.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:19.360
But I discovered that I could
travel back in time 500 years…

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.420
through the ancient well
in this shrine.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.470
AFFECTIONS TOUCHING ACROSS TIME

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.260
What is that?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.330
I'm positive that it's
a poisonous insect

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.170
from the Mainland
known as a scorpion.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.770
What's it doing here?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.430
Who cares!

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:28.280
As long as I know that it
possesses a Sacred Jewel shard!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.160
Don't be rash, Inuyasha!

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.010
I warned you.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.590
Reckless as usual.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.900
Kirara, let's go!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.980
'Kay! Me too!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.610
I'm just a little kid.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.120
What the heck!

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:22.310
The Feudal Era is full
of monsters and demons.

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:23.650
It was during this period that

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.400
Inuyasha was bound
to the sacred tree.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:29.570
Oh… Inuyasha's father was a
demon and his mother was human,

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.470
making him a half-demon.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:33.370
He's rough and spoiled
and ill-tempered…

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.350
and gets SO jealous!
He's hopeless!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.440
Well, he does have a
few redeeming qualities.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.880
Inuyasha was looking for the
Sacred Jewel of the Four Souls.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.530
But Priestess Kikyo sealed him
to this tree fifty years ago.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.490
They had been very close until
something tore them apart…

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.870
But that's a separate story.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.680
The Sacred Jewel of the
Four Souls is able to…

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.370
increase the power
of demon creatures.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.730
I'm to blame that
it was shattered

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.250
into hundreds of fragments.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:13.100
That's why Inuyasha and I are
collecting the Jewel shards.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.030
We have some very
dependable friends.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.340
Help!

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.410
A fox demon child named
Shippo who uses Fox Magic.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.780
Hiraikotsu!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.500
An amazingly strong
Demon Slayer named Sango.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.360
Sango!

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.820
And notoriously
flirtatious Monk Miroku,

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:47.970
who has a Wind
Tunnel in his palm

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.150
which can suck up everything.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.420
You're not hurt?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.660
Thank you, Miroku.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:53.880
You saved…me!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.150
Keep your hands to yourself!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.680
It's not what you think!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.250
I was just making sure that your
flawless skin wasn't harmed.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.610
Don't bother!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:10.240
And also, Sango's reliable
companion, Kirara.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:17.080
Oh yes. I forgot one more.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.290
Old Myoga, the Flea Demon.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.430
He's very knowledgeable, but…

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.700
Huh? Kagome!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:27.790
Hey!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.500
Smushed!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.280
Kagome!
What have you been doing?

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:36.470
Master Inuyasha is
already in battle.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.810
Which means, Myoga,
you ran away again.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:40.890
Huh?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.940
Fool! I just came to get
you since you were so slow!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.770
You're always the first to
disappear when danger strikes.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.400
Why you!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.500
Are you all right, Inuyasha?!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.820
I just can't get
into the swing of it!

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:15.490
You are hopeless when
Kagome isn't around!

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.890
Say that again!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.840
Inuyasha! Everyone!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.600
Kagome!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.060
Kagome!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:24.810
Kagome!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.770
What've you been doin'?!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.280
I got delayed making
bento lunches.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.800
Hah! This isn't a picnic!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.070
That's a woman for you!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.420
I apologized!

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.610
That's right!

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.460
– Are you all right? – I'm okay.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.530
Kagome, where's the Jewel shard?

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:54.420
Umm…

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.260
I see it!

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.810
On its tail! At the tip.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:04.560
Awright!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.520
Hiraikotsu!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.570
Take this! Tetsusaiga!

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.740
You did it!

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.170
Kagome!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.580
Leave the rest to me.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.380
Wind Tunnel!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.520
We did it!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.820
Oh dear…

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:06.770
What're you doing?

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.620
Hurry and get the Jewel shard.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:09.710
But…

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:11.750
Weakling!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.780
Thank goodness!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.630
You're amazing, Kagome.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.550
The demonic aura
has been purified.

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.770
Finally found it!

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:39.220
– Ruri. – Yes?

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.610
– Hari. – Yes?

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.790
The time has come.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:45.660
– We are ready. – We are ready.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:10.760
Now then… I made special
lunches for us today.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.940
Hey, that's wonderful!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.860
How fortunate! Eating your
home-cooking in such a place.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:22.150
Hmm… Never seen some of this
stuff before. Is it edible?

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.200
How rude! Eat and find out!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.200
Kagome! This octopus
has only four legs!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.240
And it has no face.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.040
That's a weiner.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.540
This rice ball is good.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.910
That's because Kagome puts
such care into her cooking.

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.340
We must partake of
everything with gratitude.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.050
Huh?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.810
We haven't had
anything decent lately.

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:52.620
How is that omelet?
It's my specialty.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.100
Will you shut up?

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.720
Now, now!

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.860
Don't be so mean
to one so little.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.750
Happy, Shippo?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.750
I like this octopus.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.760
Well, how was it?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:26.620
Huh?

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.430
Did it taste good?

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.040
By the way,
didn't you bring that?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.820
"That"? What do you mean?

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:34.690
That!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.560
Oh, here it is!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.280
Kagome! Let's boil some water.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.200
Inuyasha…

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:47.900
Sit!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:53.370
Sit! Sit! Sit! Sit! Sit!
Sit! Sit! Sit! S-I-T!!!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:58.920
Just forget it!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.010
That's the most intense
"sit" I've heard yet.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.590
Punishment for not
considering Kagome's feelings.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.930
What's the matter, Kirara?

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.800
She's burning with fever.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.180
It must be the toxin
from the giant scorpion.

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.560
Let me see.
I'll suck out the poison.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:21.860
Kirara!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.030
Wait!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:29.070
Kirara's acting strange.
I'll follow Sango.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.020
That Sango… I can't believe she

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:33.950
carries this with
her all the time.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.200
They're so restless.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.910
I'll say.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.880
That stupid Inuyasha!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.220
I'll NEVER make him
lunch ever again!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.470
Jeez… Nothing good is
happening to me today.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.850
Kirara?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.520
Kirara!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:17.970
She's…

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:19.480
Yours, right?

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:21.210
She's reacting to insect poison.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:25.250
We just gave her an antidote.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.740
Thank you, I appreciate it.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.000
Not at all.
We're glad to be of help.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.890
I thank you, too.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:39.680
By the way,
I have a request of you.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.270
Will you bear my child?

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:44.750
Pardon me.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.990
I can't help myself
when I see pretty women.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:47.940
'Nough said!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.070
Are you from the Continent?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.370
Yes,
that's very observant of you.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.250
And yet, you seem to speak
our language very fluently.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.210
I suppose so.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.340
After all, we came to this land…

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.920
Over 200 years ago.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.480
Kirara!

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.810
Just what are you doing?!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.700
Scorpions?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.450
Then the giant scorpion
this morning was…

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.660
I was the one who sent it.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.960
Everything went
according to our plan.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.880
Then it was a set-up?

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:58.930
Sango!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.680
Why you—!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.610
I was waiting for you
to use that power.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.570
What?!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.000
It's useless.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.610
You cannot escape
my "duplication."

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:28.840
Duplication?

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.020
Miroku!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.110
That woman!
What did she just do?

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:58.030
It's in my possession now.
Your Wind Tunnel!

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.960
Well? How does it
feel to be sucked in?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.520
Something's interfered.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.650
But our business is done.
Let's go.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.070
Kirara!

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.190
Kirara?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.160
Kirara!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.410
What's the matter?!
Don't you recognize me?

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.500
Kirara?!

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.090
We're taking her.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.090
Damn!

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.740
It seems Kirara is under their

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:07.680
spell.
We can't let them do this.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.190
Are you two all right?

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.520
Did you shoot that
arrow, Lady Kaede?

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:20.450
There was a restlessness
in the trees, so I came.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.040
You came in the nick of time.
I'm so grateful.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.350
Are you going after those two?

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:27.140
Yes.

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.000
They headed west.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.120
In the direction of the
Forest of No Return.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.590
You must use utmost care.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.560
Restlessness in
the trees signifies

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.130
that a disaster
is about to occur.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:40.680
Or, that something
is already afoot.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.050
In any case…

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.810
Huh? No one's listening?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.170
It's sensing an
impending danger.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:18.550
A big calamity is looming.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.930
Is it after Inuyasha?

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:36.560
Oh dear… What'll I say?

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:40.860
"Mom, my bike broke.
Can you buy me a new one?"

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.200
No way she would.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.120
Huh?

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.040
Kikyo?

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.220
Inuyasha…

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.430
Huh?!

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:24.650
Cripes! Why am I hiding?
What a fool!

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.420
Wait, Inuyasha!
Where are you going?!

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:44.510
Damn that Kagome!

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:47.300
I'm gonna give her
a piece of my mind!

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:50.260
Yeah right! She's got you
wrapped around her fingers.

00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:57.310
Kikyo's soul collectors!

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.140
Master Inuyasha! What's wrong?

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:01.480
Huh? Oh, nooo…!

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:04.130
Hey, Inuyasha!

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:07.660
You must cherish your elders!
That's what Pa always told me.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:11.120
You two! Do not follow me!

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:13.370
Hey! Inuyasha!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.130
What's with him?

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:17.540
Curse of the octopus.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.550
The sacred tree…

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.390
This is where I
first met Inuyasha.

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:42.230
And it's where Kikyo
and Inuyasha parted.

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:46.490
But…

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.700
Actually,
they were drawn to each other.

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:54.330
Kikyo still loves Inuyasha.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:02.000
Ooh! I have to get back soon!

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:05.420
Huh?

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:08.340
What's this?

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:15.680
Oww!

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:20.730
What am I doing?!

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:25.030
I should've just gone home.

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:30.490
I'm here in this age…

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:33.020
to gather the pieces
of the Sacred Jewel

00:24:33.020 --> 00:24:35.080
and restore it to
its original shape.

00:24:36.740 --> 00:24:40.960
But Kikyo can also
find the shards.

00:24:42.670 --> 00:24:44.460
The reason why I stay here is…

00:24:53.430 --> 00:24:54.600
Inuyasha!

00:24:58.140 --> 00:25:00.140
Silly! You cut yourself?

00:25:01.430 --> 00:25:04.400
If Old Myoga were here
now, he'd be real happy.

00:25:05.270 --> 00:25:06.400
Huh?!

00:25:07.400 --> 00:25:08.520
What is it?

00:25:08.520 --> 00:25:11.820
My favorite handkerchief!

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:14.370
It's just a piece of cloth.

00:25:14.830 --> 00:25:16.740
Anyways, are you alone?

00:25:17.120 --> 00:25:18.330
What do you mean?

00:25:18.330 --> 00:25:19.830
Err…nothing.

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:25.170
You came to look for
Kikyo, right?

00:25:27.210 --> 00:25:29.670
So you did follow Kikyo's scent!

00:25:30.130 --> 00:25:32.420
Will you shut up?!

00:25:34.180 --> 00:25:35.430
There! It's done.

00:25:35.430 --> 00:25:36.470
Let's go!

00:25:39.810 --> 00:25:44.380
No matter how far
apart they are,

00:25:44.380 --> 00:25:46.320
they still care
about each other.

00:25:47.110 --> 00:25:51.030
There's no place for me.
I knew that.

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:04.020
Human-eating moths?!

00:26:04.020 --> 00:26:07.460
What're all these moths?!
How creepy!

00:26:09.000 --> 00:26:12.010
Kagome! Hold your breath
or else you'll faint.

00:26:13.550 --> 00:26:15.400
For how long?!

00:26:15.400 --> 00:26:19.180
Until I get rid of them.
What else?!

00:26:22.680 --> 00:26:24.270
Iron-reaver, Soul-stealer!

00:26:25.940 --> 00:26:27.610
There's no end to this!

00:26:28.070 --> 00:26:29.810
Damn, I'll get them all at once.

00:26:36.030 --> 00:26:36.870
What's that?!

00:26:41.290 --> 00:26:42.490
Inuyasha?

00:26:42.490 --> 00:26:42.510
I don't know who you are!
Inuyasha?

00:26:42.510 --> 00:26:44.830
I don't know who you are!

00:26:45.540 --> 00:26:47.520
My name is Menomaru.

00:26:47.520 --> 00:26:51.130
Inuyasha… Receive the
baptism of my sword!

00:27:00.100 --> 00:27:01.290
Good!

00:27:01.290 --> 00:27:03.650
That blade is the
fang of destruction!

00:27:03.650 --> 00:27:04.860
What?

00:27:04.860 --> 00:27:07.600
Will you quit talking nonsense?!

00:27:09.520 --> 00:27:10.520
Are you all right?

00:27:10.520 --> 00:27:12.230
I can't hold it anymore…

00:27:13.280 --> 00:27:14.070
Fool!

00:27:15.530 --> 00:27:18.820
How wasteful to use
it to protect a human.

00:27:19.530 --> 00:27:21.760
I will make it worth its while.

00:27:21.760 --> 00:27:23.580
Now, hand it over!

00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:25.080
Quit joking!

00:27:30.540 --> 00:27:32.630
He deflected my Tetsusaiga!

00:27:38.630 --> 00:27:41.630
I have to finish him off
quickly or Kagome's in trouble.

00:27:41.630 --> 00:27:43.560
Iron-reaver, Soul-stealer!

00:27:50.060 --> 00:27:52.650
Damn!
My vision's getting blurred!

00:28:09.750 --> 00:28:13.210
Damn… I can't move!

00:28:15.590 --> 00:28:19.260
How hopeless.
Losing consciousness so soon?

00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:31.600
Inuyasha…

00:28:32.600 --> 00:28:34.420
I'm going to test
the cutting edge

00:28:34.420 --> 00:28:36.320
of this fang of
destruction on you.

00:28:41.610 --> 00:28:42.610
A barrier?

00:29:09.100 --> 00:29:10.890
Of all the luck…

00:29:11.600 --> 00:29:14.150
You're the only one
who can wield it?

00:29:17.440 --> 00:29:19.900
Maybe I can use that girl…

00:29:34.540 --> 00:29:36.530
Don't move, Inuyasha!

00:29:36.530 --> 00:29:38.590
We just tended to your wounds.

00:29:38.590 --> 00:29:40.540
What if you open them up again?

00:29:40.540 --> 00:29:42.380
These are mere scratches!

00:29:43.180 --> 00:29:44.380
Where is he?

00:29:44.800 --> 00:29:46.010
He?

00:29:46.010 --> 00:29:49.550
The one called Menomaru…
that disgusting demon!

00:29:49.550 --> 00:29:52.680
Menomaru?
Are you sure about that?

00:29:58.690 --> 00:30:02.070
Where are Sango and
Miroku, anyway?

00:30:03.410 --> 00:30:05.700
And jeez, Kagome is gone, too.

00:30:05.700 --> 00:30:06.830
That guy…!

00:30:07.370 --> 00:30:09.100
He took Kagome.

00:30:09.100 --> 00:30:10.270
What?!

00:30:10.270 --> 00:30:12.790
Kagome didn't go back to
the world beyond the well?

00:30:13.370 --> 00:30:15.880
Kagome wouldn't go home
without first telling me!

00:30:16.790 --> 00:30:18.610
How disappointing!

00:30:18.610 --> 00:30:21.610
Can't you even look after
your girl properly?!

00:30:21.610 --> 00:30:22.460
Shaddup!

00:30:23.720 --> 00:30:25.870
Hey, I'm the one who
tended to your wounds!

00:30:25.870 --> 00:30:28.720
I don't consider these wounds!

00:30:29.720 --> 00:30:30.720
Master Inuyasha!

00:30:31.020 --> 00:30:34.220
You're sure this demon
called himself Menomaru?

00:30:34.600 --> 00:30:37.440
Yeah, no mistake about it!
You know him?

00:30:39.650 --> 00:30:41.580
Menomaru is the only
son of Hyoga, an

00:30:41.580 --> 00:30:43.380
infamous demon
from the continent.

00:30:43.380 --> 00:30:44.720
Demon from the continent?

00:30:44.720 --> 00:30:45.700
Exactly!

00:30:46.070 --> 00:30:48.240
200 years ago,

00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:51.870
a huge Mongol army from the
continent began an attack.

00:30:52.960 --> 00:30:55.350
And demons and monsters
came to this nation…

00:30:55.350 --> 00:30:58.270
to snatch the souls of
those killed in battle.

00:30:58.270 --> 00:31:02.210
At that time, your father
ruled the regions of the West.

00:31:02.210 --> 00:31:04.760
Hyoga and your father
battled ferociously,

00:31:04.760 --> 00:31:06.860
calling forth
thunder and winds and

00:31:06.860 --> 00:31:08.930
causing a terrible,
violent storm.

00:31:10.760 --> 00:31:13.830
Using one of his fangs,
your father sealed Hyoga

00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:16.190
and thus, I
understand, chased the

00:31:16.190 --> 00:31:18.640
foreign demons back
to the continent.

00:31:18.640 --> 00:31:18.670
So you didn't witness
it personally?
foreign demons back
to the continent.

00:31:18.670 --> 00:31:20.770
So you didn't witness
it personally?

00:31:20.770 --> 00:31:23.110
Err… Well…

00:31:23.110 --> 00:31:26.480
Guess you ran away
from danger even then.

00:31:26.480 --> 00:31:31.660
Well, your father…and you…
are always so reckless.

00:31:32.780 --> 00:31:35.790
Where was this Hyoga
put under seal?

00:31:35.790 --> 00:31:38.250
Well, I've heard that before.

00:31:38.670 --> 00:31:39.420
Where?!

00:31:39.790 --> 00:31:41.920
The Tree of Ages in the
Forest of No Return.

00:31:42.800 --> 00:31:44.460
The Tree of Ages?

00:31:46.800 --> 00:31:48.800
Hey, Inuyasha!

00:31:49.510 --> 00:31:51.800
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:32:06.740 --> 00:32:08.030
Lord Menomaru!

00:32:08.410 --> 00:32:09.910
How did it go?

00:32:09.910 --> 00:32:11.820
As you can see.

00:32:11.820 --> 00:32:13.320
That girl?

00:32:13.320 --> 00:32:15.720
My bait to lure him here.

00:32:15.720 --> 00:32:17.830
Inuyasha is coming here?

00:32:18.750 --> 00:32:21.790
The fang of destruction
has a barrier.

00:32:22.090 --> 00:32:22.970
Then…

00:32:22.970 --> 00:32:25.300
Only he can wield it.

00:32:25.840 --> 00:32:28.530
Unless the seal around
this fang is broken,

00:32:28.530 --> 00:32:30.980
the succession ceremony
cannot be held.

00:32:30.980 --> 00:32:34.820
And Inuyasha's Tetsusaiga is
necessary for that purpose.

00:32:34.820 --> 00:32:38.760
However, will a mortal girl
like her be bait enough?

00:32:38.760 --> 00:32:40.070
He will come.

00:32:40.070 --> 00:32:42.770
That family likes humans.

00:32:43.440 --> 00:32:46.940
Inuyasha's father fell in
love with a mortal woman.

00:32:47.570 --> 00:32:50.840
And Inuyasha,
in whom flows human blood,

00:32:50.840 --> 00:32:52.950
has fallen in love with
yet another mortal.

00:32:53.580 --> 00:32:55.910
Such eccentrics they are.

00:32:56.700 --> 00:32:58.220
– Hari! – Yes?

00:32:58.220 --> 00:32:59.870
Take over this girl.

00:32:59.870 --> 00:33:00.870
Huh?

00:33:03.380 --> 00:33:06.920
I have an amusing idea of how
to get rid of that half-demon.

00:33:07.460 --> 00:33:09.010
I understand.

00:33:23.900 --> 00:33:24.730
Huh?

00:33:25.900 --> 00:33:27.150
What's the matter, Hari?

00:33:27.150 --> 00:33:30.650
This girl possesses unusually
strong spiritual powers.

00:33:31.030 --> 00:33:32.240
Could she be a priestess?

00:33:32.570 --> 00:33:33.570
Impossible.

00:33:33.910 --> 00:33:35.990
Look at the odd
way she's dressed.

00:33:40.660 --> 00:33:42.200
Try using this.

00:33:42.200 --> 00:33:43.900
A Sacred Jewel shard?

00:33:43.900 --> 00:33:45.000
Are you sure?

00:33:46.460 --> 00:33:49.920
One with true power has
no need of such a thing.

00:34:11.280 --> 00:34:12.320
What is this?!

00:34:16.200 --> 00:34:19.240
This girl! She easily broke
the roots holding her!

00:34:19.950 --> 00:34:23.370
It seems that she does
possess spiritual powers.

00:34:24.960 --> 00:34:27.710
Who are you?!
Where is Inuyasha?!

00:34:28.090 --> 00:34:31.170
Do not worry.
He will be here shortly.

00:34:31.920 --> 00:34:33.260
What do you intend
to do with me?!

00:34:38.390 --> 00:34:39.430
Kirara…?!

00:34:40.390 --> 00:34:43.020
What did you do to Kirara?

00:34:43.440 --> 00:34:45.520
She belongs to us now.

00:34:45.980 --> 00:34:46.980
Huh?!

00:34:51.980 --> 00:34:53.490
Return Kirara back to normal!

00:34:53.990 --> 00:34:55.930
You're a feisty one.

00:34:55.930 --> 00:34:57.370
I'm serious!

00:34:57.830 --> 00:35:01.450
My friends,
keep this girl company.

00:35:20.350 --> 00:35:21.430
Hiraikotsu!

00:35:28.520 --> 00:35:29.430
Sango!

00:35:29.430 --> 00:35:30.400
Miroku!

00:35:30.860 --> 00:35:31.780
Kagome!

00:35:32.190 --> 00:35:35.070
Not only Kirara… but you
too, Kagome?!

00:35:35.910 --> 00:35:38.030
I don't know what
you're scheming…

00:35:38.950 --> 00:35:40.200
but we're taking these two back!

00:35:46.870 --> 00:35:47.540
Kirara!

00:35:48.080 --> 00:35:51.210
She doesn't want
to return to you.

00:36:02.680 --> 00:36:03.310
Sango!

00:36:03.890 --> 00:36:05.600
I'm your opponent!

00:36:25.080 --> 00:36:26.500
I told you I'm serious!

00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:28.290
I won't miss the next shot.

00:36:29.080 --> 00:36:30.150
Young girl…

00:36:30.150 --> 00:36:33.090
You're bait, so act like bait.

00:36:34.010 --> 00:36:35.340
What bait?!

00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:38.550
He's fast!

00:36:39.890 --> 00:36:40.930
Kagome!

00:36:41.390 --> 00:36:42.430
Duck!

00:36:43.100 --> 00:36:44.140
Inuyasha!

00:36:44.970 --> 00:36:46.930
Take this!

00:36:52.860 --> 00:36:54.320
I was tired of
waiting, Inuyasha.

00:36:56.110 --> 00:36:57.280
Oh yeah?

00:36:57.650 --> 00:36:59.320
I'm taking Kagome back.

00:37:00.570 --> 00:37:02.700
Inuyasha!

00:37:03.410 --> 00:37:04.120
Kirara!

00:37:10.750 --> 00:37:11.460
Kirara!

00:37:13.920 --> 00:37:15.250
Something's wrong!

00:37:16.670 --> 00:37:18.010
Kagome, move away!

00:37:22.130 --> 00:37:23.430
Where are you aiming?

00:37:35.860 --> 00:37:36.820
I did it!

00:37:47.540 --> 00:37:48.500
What the—?!

00:37:51.620 --> 00:37:53.750
Damn it! What's going on?!

00:37:55.040 --> 00:37:56.670
I am immortal.

00:37:57.170 --> 00:37:58.720
Master Inuyasha!

00:37:58.720 --> 00:38:01.170
Menomaru absorbs
demon power from

00:38:01.170 --> 00:38:03.430
Hyoga who stands behind him.

00:38:04.680 --> 00:38:07.290
Hyoga? That one?

00:38:07.290 --> 00:38:10.240
Hyoga's physical self
perished long ago.

00:38:10.240 --> 00:38:14.860
But his near-limitless
power lies sealed inside.

00:38:16.770 --> 00:38:18.270
Old Myoga, is it?

00:38:18.270 --> 00:38:20.660
It's unusual for you to stay.

00:38:20.660 --> 00:38:24.310
Silence!
I can't wait to get away!

00:38:24.310 --> 00:38:27.860
Master Inuyasha,
hurry and untie this thread!

00:38:27.860 --> 00:38:30.430
After you tell me
how to beat this guy!

00:38:30.430 --> 00:38:31.740
Be reasonable!

00:38:32.040 --> 00:38:32.790
It's useless!

00:38:34.080 --> 00:38:36.380
You cannot defeat me.

00:38:37.210 --> 00:38:39.090
Demon power of whatever…

00:38:39.090 --> 00:38:41.710
I just hafta beat the
hell outta you, right?

00:38:42.050 --> 00:38:45.170
Interesting. Try it.

00:38:45.510 --> 00:38:46.720
Something's wrong.

00:38:47.100 --> 00:38:48.350
Be careful, Inuyasha!

00:38:48.760 --> 00:38:50.430
Don't take me lightly!

00:38:51.730 --> 00:38:54.270
No, you must stop,
Master Inuyasha!

00:38:58.230 --> 00:38:59.960
Wind Scar!

00:38:59.960 --> 00:39:01.230
No!

00:39:08.240 --> 00:39:10.790
Yes! This is the
moment I've waited for!

00:39:25.260 --> 00:39:26.260
I did it!

00:39:39.770 --> 00:39:42.140
The seal has been broken!

00:39:42.140 --> 00:39:43.150
What?!

00:39:50.160 --> 00:39:51.280
It's collapsing!

00:39:51.280 --> 00:39:52.740
Hurry and get away!

00:39:52.740 --> 00:39:53.500
Yeah!

00:40:23.650 --> 00:40:25.240
Inuyasha! Kagome!

00:40:26.950 --> 00:40:28.320
Are you all right, Kagome?!

00:40:28.320 --> 00:40:29.300
Uh-huh…

00:40:29.300 --> 00:40:31.320
But Sango and Miroku are…

00:40:35.830 --> 00:40:36.580
I'm here.

00:40:38.330 --> 00:40:39.880
Everyone accounted for?

00:41:27.090 --> 00:41:29.770
I must thank you, Inuyasha!

00:41:29.770 --> 00:41:30.660
What?!

00:41:30.660 --> 00:41:34.530
My father, Hyoga,
lost to your father in battle…

00:41:34.530 --> 00:41:36.470
and was put under
seal at this spot.

00:41:36.890 --> 00:41:39.410
The fang your brother
Sesshomaru wields…

00:41:39.410 --> 00:41:41.790
does not have the power
to break the seal.

00:41:41.790 --> 00:41:43.500
The one that does have the power

00:41:43.500 --> 00:41:46.980
is the one left to
you, named Tetsusaiga!

00:41:48.400 --> 00:41:52.070
Tetsusaiga? You…you used me!

00:41:53.410 --> 00:41:58.790
Now…I can take over
everything from my family!

00:42:18.560 --> 00:42:19.430
What's this?!

00:42:19.930 --> 00:42:23.130
That is the succession
ceremony of the Hyoga clan.

00:42:23.130 --> 00:42:24.440
Succession ceremony?

00:42:24.770 --> 00:42:27.460
Menomaru is able to possess
the power of his father

00:42:27.460 --> 00:42:31.400
and transform into a
demon even more powerful.

00:43:04.350 --> 00:43:05.770
Our new Lord Hyoga!

00:43:06.190 --> 00:43:07.940
Our new lord and master!

00:43:09.480 --> 00:43:10.480
It's the end.

00:43:11.480 --> 00:43:13.760
Menomaru has absorbed
the demon power…

00:43:13.760 --> 00:43:16.140
and become the new Hyoga.

00:43:16.140 --> 00:43:18.800
No one can defeat him now.

00:43:18.800 --> 00:43:21.250
Hah!
My father beat him, didn't he?

00:43:21.250 --> 00:43:23.020
Each generation
of Hyogas absorbs

00:43:23.020 --> 00:43:24.500
the power of the previous one…

00:43:24.500 --> 00:43:26.460
and increases in strength.

00:43:26.960 --> 00:43:29.320
Menomaru…rather the new Hyoga,

00:43:29.320 --> 00:43:34.050
is much more powerful than
the one your father defeated.

00:43:36.670 --> 00:43:37.910
From this point on,

00:43:37.910 --> 00:43:39.850
in order to transform
into an even

00:43:39.850 --> 00:43:41.510
more powerful demon, he will…

00:43:42.510 --> 00:43:43.520
Who cares?!

00:43:44.180 --> 00:43:45.140
Inuyasha!

00:43:47.520 --> 00:43:49.600
I just hafta beat this
guy, right?!

00:43:49.600 --> 00:43:53.360
Please…untie this string!

00:43:58.450 --> 00:43:59.830
Take this!

00:44:09.540 --> 00:44:10.670
Half-demon!

00:44:11.340 --> 00:44:15.630
I will never allow a lowlife
like you to touch me!

00:44:34.320 --> 00:44:36.570
Please stop…!

00:44:37.360 --> 00:44:39.620
Don't die so soon, half-demon.

00:44:39.620 --> 00:44:44.240
I've made special arrangements
regarding your death.

00:44:46.290 --> 00:44:47.960
What're you saying?!

00:44:48.500 --> 00:44:50.630
I'll bet you're just
scared to fight me!

00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:52.920
Now come on out!

00:44:53.920 --> 00:44:56.590
You talk like you mean it.

00:45:04.010 --> 00:45:05.580
Hey, Myoga!

00:45:05.580 --> 00:45:07.080
Can't you remember anything?

00:45:07.080 --> 00:45:09.600
Like his weakness or
a way to kill him?!

00:45:12.600 --> 00:45:15.320
If you don't wanna die,
hurry and remember!

00:45:20.610 --> 00:45:23.530
You still don't get it?
How strong I am?!

00:45:24.540 --> 00:45:25.160
Huh?!

00:45:25.790 --> 00:45:27.080
This is in your honor!

00:45:28.910 --> 00:45:31.040
Disappear completely from
the face of the earth!

00:45:53.650 --> 00:45:56.280
Gather round!
All who worship me!

00:45:56.650 --> 00:46:00.650
Bring to me every soul
of every living thing!

00:46:53.750 --> 00:46:54.750
W-What—!

00:46:55.540 --> 00:46:56.730
What is it?

00:46:56.730 --> 00:46:58.340
Mommy! Look!

00:47:09.010 --> 00:47:09.740
How creepy!

00:47:09.740 --> 00:47:10.720
Mommy!

00:47:11.140 --> 00:47:12.210
What is it?

00:47:12.210 --> 00:47:13.310
I'm scared!

00:48:14.660 --> 00:48:15.890
The Tree of Ages…!

00:48:15.890 --> 00:48:17.750
What is going on?!

00:48:18.790 --> 00:48:20.460
Something's coming!

00:48:21.670 --> 00:48:22.380
So many!

00:48:22.790 --> 00:48:23.670
Looks like bugs!

00:48:25.340 --> 00:48:26.090
Oh no!

00:48:54.240 --> 00:48:55.200
Lady Kaede!

00:48:55.200 --> 00:48:58.580
Just what is going on?

00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:01.580
Old Kaede…

00:49:03.300 --> 00:49:04.380
Kagome!

00:49:07.920 --> 00:49:09.050
Kagome!

00:49:09.510 --> 00:49:10.380
Kagome!!

00:49:20.480 --> 00:49:22.330
Rin, stay away.

00:49:22.330 --> 00:49:23.070
Yes!

00:49:25.690 --> 00:49:29.400
Lord Sesshomaru,
do not bother with this.

00:49:29.740 --> 00:49:31.860
I, Jaken, shall take care of it.

00:49:35.660 --> 00:49:38.460
Witness the power of
the Staff of Two Heads!

00:49:50.090 --> 00:49:53.220
It's a hundred years too soon
to confront Lord Sesshomaru.

00:49:54.680 --> 00:49:55.890
W-What—?!

00:49:56.350 --> 00:49:58.370
I can't see in front of me!

00:49:58.370 --> 00:50:00.890
It's too dark! I can't see…!

00:50:05.480 --> 00:50:07.650
Lord Sesshomaru, you're amazing!

00:50:08.150 --> 00:50:09.970
Hyoga has been resurrected.

00:50:09.970 --> 00:50:12.070
You did it, Lord Sesshomaru!

00:50:14.530 --> 00:50:18.290
No, don't leave me!
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:50:20.910 --> 00:50:23.710
How mean you are to Jaken!

00:50:40.930 --> 00:50:43.650
Are you okay, Miroku?

00:50:45.060 --> 00:50:48.940
Hyoga is absorbing the souls
of every living thing around.

00:50:49.820 --> 00:50:51.940
We must maintain constant
vigilance and be strong,

00:50:51.940 --> 00:50:53.950
or we'll become his prey.

00:50:55.070 --> 00:50:57.930
Well whatever,
he's just too strong.

00:50:57.930 --> 00:51:02.410
You all admit that this
time, your hands are tied.

00:51:02.960 --> 00:51:04.190
I'm going.

00:51:04.190 --> 00:51:06.710
I won't leave Kirara like that.

00:51:07.090 --> 00:51:08.780
I'm coming, too.

00:51:08.780 --> 00:51:12.960
I can't stand by while my
Wind Tunnel is used for evil.

00:51:12.960 --> 00:51:14.920
It's hopeless, you two!

00:51:15.340 --> 00:51:17.850
Some good will come of this.

00:51:17.850 --> 00:51:19.140
We'll do something.

00:51:21.520 --> 00:51:24.660
Well, if you insist,
I won't try to stop you.

00:51:24.660 --> 00:51:26.790
But it's gonna take
much more to climb…

00:51:26.790 --> 00:51:28.250
that huge Tree of Ages…

00:51:28.250 --> 00:51:29.020
Huh?

00:51:31.650 --> 00:51:36.990
Huh?! No!
Give me a break, Miroku!

00:51:37.990 --> 00:51:40.990
Do you want to be sucked in?!

00:51:43.500 --> 00:51:46.910
Awright! Awright! Crooked monk!

00:51:50.550 --> 00:51:53.000
What's the sense of transforming
in this small space?!

00:51:53.000 --> 00:51:54.970
I'll really suck you up!

00:52:05.140 --> 00:52:07.060
Damn… This stupid injury!

00:52:07.480 --> 00:52:10.920
Master Inuyasha…
It's dangerous here.

00:52:10.920 --> 00:52:14.700
Let us return to the West
and recoup our strength.

00:52:14.700 --> 00:52:15.990
Running away?

00:52:18.320 --> 00:52:22.560
The Hyoga Clan have
spent the last 200 years…

00:52:22.560 --> 00:52:25.540
planning to take revenge.

00:52:26.000 --> 00:52:30.210
In order to stand up to them,
we need just as much time.

00:52:30.540 --> 00:52:33.990
Please wait until you're just
as powerful as your father was.

00:52:33.990 --> 00:52:35.070
Shaddup!

00:52:35.070 --> 00:52:36.610
I'm impatient!

00:52:36.610 --> 00:52:37.570
But…!

00:52:37.570 --> 00:52:39.160
No buts!

00:52:39.160 --> 00:52:40.570
I'm going back!

00:52:40.570 --> 00:52:42.660
Impossible! Master Inuyasha!

00:52:42.660 --> 00:52:43.770
Quiet!

00:52:54.060 --> 00:52:55.400
No…!

00:52:59.530 --> 00:53:00.780
W-Whaa—?!

00:53:02.530 --> 00:53:04.080
You bother me!

00:53:04.080 --> 00:53:06.290
Just go away somewhere!

00:53:07.120 --> 00:53:09.170
I'm going alone!

00:53:10.080 --> 00:53:13.070
No! I will not allow this!

00:53:13.070 --> 00:53:16.090
I will stop you
even if it kills me!

00:53:17.930 --> 00:53:20.650
If you insist, Master Inuyasha…

00:53:20.650 --> 00:53:23.390
do it over my dead body!

00:53:25.980 --> 00:53:27.810
Master Inuyasha!

00:53:33.110 --> 00:53:34.420
Inuyasha…

00:53:34.420 --> 00:53:37.030
Is your persistence
a human trait?

00:53:37.570 --> 00:53:40.240
Then I'll have some
amusement at your expense.

00:53:55.500 --> 00:53:57.380
What's wrong, Kagome?

00:53:58.050 --> 00:53:59.090
Water…

00:54:06.390 --> 00:54:08.140
My head hurts…

00:54:09.560 --> 00:54:10.520
I feel sick…

00:54:20.990 --> 00:54:22.150
Kagome?

00:54:26.160 --> 00:54:27.830
Kagome! What's the matter?

00:54:27.830 --> 00:54:30.460
– Kagome! – No!
I can't control myself!

00:54:31.580 --> 00:54:33.630
Get away! Old Kaede!

00:54:53.190 --> 00:54:54.190
Kikyo?

00:54:58.190 --> 00:54:59.060
Kagome!

00:55:01.860 --> 00:55:04.000
– You're all right!
You're not hurt!

00:55:04.000 --> 00:55:05.740
– Inuyasha! Get away! Please!

00:55:06.070 --> 00:55:10.120
You look so pale.
Go back to Kaede and rest.

00:55:13.210 --> 00:55:14.210
Kagome?

00:55:15.170 --> 00:55:18.080
Sorry… I was right
there with you, but…

00:55:18.920 --> 00:55:20.260
Inuyasha…

00:55:22.010 --> 00:55:23.090
Get away…

00:55:23.090 --> 00:55:24.220
Huh?

00:55:29.550 --> 00:55:31.260
K-Kagome!

00:55:33.690 --> 00:55:34.730
Inuyasha!

00:55:39.940 --> 00:55:41.150
Someone's manipulating her!

00:55:45.070 --> 00:55:46.070
Damn!

00:55:46.660 --> 00:55:48.160
Is it that guy?!

00:55:48.780 --> 00:55:51.240
Inuyasha! Please! Get away!

00:55:52.580 --> 00:55:54.250
Snap out of it, Kagome!

00:56:07.510 --> 00:56:09.350
Die! Inuyasha!

00:56:23.440 --> 00:56:25.860
How long can you keep
running, Inuyasha?

00:56:26.280 --> 00:56:28.780
Damn! What'm I gonna do?!

00:56:37.410 --> 00:56:39.080
Making Kagome do this!

00:56:39.960 --> 00:56:42.460
Damn that Menomaru!
He won't get away with this!

00:56:46.210 --> 00:56:49.260
Am I imagining it? Or is
the circle getting bigger?

00:56:49.260 --> 00:56:52.080
The souls he's devoured
have made him bigger.

00:56:52.080 --> 00:56:54.100
Is he a growing boy?

00:56:54.560 --> 00:56:57.180
Hope he doesn't grow too much.

00:56:57.810 --> 00:57:00.440
Kirara… I promise
to get you back.

00:57:28.130 --> 00:57:29.090
Kikyo!

00:57:46.190 --> 00:57:48.360
This is just like the last time.

00:57:50.530 --> 00:57:55.200
No, that's not Kikyo.
It's Kagome!

00:57:56.330 --> 00:58:01.040
Inuyasha! Please!
Get away from me!

00:58:01.370 --> 00:58:03.300
– Run! – Do it!

00:58:03.300 --> 00:58:04.380
Run!

00:58:04.960 --> 00:58:06.930
Deliver the final blow!

00:58:06.930 --> 00:58:08.300
Run!

00:58:09.380 --> 00:58:11.050
Die, Inuyasha!

00:58:11.380 --> 00:58:12.630
Hiraikotsu!

00:58:25.520 --> 00:58:26.650
Humans…

00:58:31.860 --> 00:58:34.550
Well then, Miroku… Sango…

00:58:34.550 --> 00:58:36.200
Hang in there.

00:58:36.910 --> 00:58:40.500
I'm impressed that Hachi brought
us this far, in this miasma.

00:58:41.080 --> 00:58:42.040
Miroku…

00:58:43.250 --> 00:58:44.250
Sango…

00:58:44.750 --> 00:58:46.360
Why are you stroking my hand?

00:58:46.360 --> 00:58:49.280
This may be the last
moment of our lives.

00:58:49.280 --> 00:58:50.840
Stop uttering such nonsense!

00:58:55.430 --> 00:58:57.910
Coming here knowing
it's hopeless…

00:58:57.910 --> 00:58:59.780
Humans are such
strange creatures.

00:58:59.780 --> 00:59:02.190
I wonder about that?

00:59:11.740 --> 00:59:15.700
Inuyasha! Get away! Please!

00:59:17.830 --> 00:59:21.870
My body won't listen…to me.

00:59:22.870 --> 00:59:24.380
Like this…

00:59:25.210 --> 00:59:26.750
Like this…

00:59:27.210 --> 00:59:28.460
I'll end up…

00:59:28.460 --> 00:59:31.500
Damn! Cut it out!

00:59:33.880 --> 00:59:36.910
I'm sick of hearing
you and everyone else…

00:59:36.910 --> 00:59:39.390
telling me to get away!

00:59:39.390 --> 00:59:40.980
I'm not running away!

00:59:41.560 --> 00:59:45.520
I refuse to leave you behind!

00:59:57.120 --> 00:59:58.240
Wind Tunnel!

01:00:07.250 --> 01:00:08.500
Wind Tunnel!

01:00:30.980 --> 01:00:32.610
I'll be your opponent!

01:00:42.530 --> 01:00:44.540
Petty interference…

01:00:48.540 --> 01:00:50.540
That sound again…

01:00:55.130 --> 01:00:58.470
Damn…moth poison.

01:01:11.560 --> 01:01:16.570
Inuyasha… No… No…!

01:01:17.200 --> 01:01:18.280
No!

01:01:19.660 --> 01:01:22.570
Nooo!!

01:01:29.580 --> 01:01:30.580
Kagome…

01:01:40.220 --> 01:01:41.180
Inuyasha!

01:01:42.680 --> 01:01:45.600
Inuyasha!!

01:02:05.620 --> 01:02:06.790
Inuyasha…

01:02:10.290 --> 01:02:11.190
Inuyasha!

01:02:11.190 --> 01:02:14.090
Inuyasha! Wake up!
Open your eyes!

01:02:14.790 --> 01:02:17.760
Inuyasha, I'm sorry!
I'm so sorry!

01:02:19.630 --> 01:02:21.300
Serves you right.

01:02:22.630 --> 01:02:23.700
Kikyo…

01:02:23.700 --> 01:02:26.640
The situation… This spot…

01:02:27.640 --> 01:02:30.060
You are just my reincarnation.

01:02:30.520 --> 01:02:32.570
Walking the same path I did.

01:02:32.570 --> 01:02:36.710
Now, take this and
return to your world.

01:02:36.710 --> 01:02:37.650
No!

01:02:38.490 --> 01:02:41.740
You never belonged to this era.

01:02:42.610 --> 01:02:44.640
You are a foreigner…

01:02:44.640 --> 01:02:46.660
who stumbled upon
this world of ours.

01:02:46.660 --> 01:02:48.740
But I can't leave Inuyasha.

01:02:51.080 --> 01:02:53.460
You are the one who
injured Inuyasha!

01:02:56.550 --> 01:02:57.760
Heed my words…

01:02:57.760 --> 01:03:01.160
Hyoga is using the
formidable Tree of Ages…

01:03:01.160 --> 01:03:04.760
in order to increase
his demon powers.

01:03:05.550 --> 01:03:06.530
Tree of Ages?

01:03:06.530 --> 01:03:10.050
Yes,
this is also a Tree of Ages.

01:03:10.050 --> 01:03:11.720
This sacred tree?

01:03:11.720 --> 01:03:15.780
The Tree of Ages lives
through different times.

01:03:15.780 --> 01:03:19.010
Hyoga's Tree of Ages steals
energy from various generations…

01:03:19.010 --> 01:03:20.420
and matures.

01:03:20.420 --> 01:03:24.280
By now, other generations
of time have frozen over.

01:03:24.990 --> 01:03:29.620
Your time is going through
a never-ending winter now.

01:03:40.040 --> 01:03:44.050
Oh dear… It's suddenly
gotten so cold.

01:03:44.720 --> 01:03:45.720
Huh?

01:04:02.860 --> 01:04:04.590
The flowers!

01:04:04.590 --> 01:04:06.820
After they finally bloomed!

01:04:18.920 --> 01:04:20.210
It's sprouting…

01:04:20.630 --> 01:04:22.420
On a well this ancient?

01:04:23.130 --> 01:04:26.050
This well was constructed out
of wood from the Tree of Ages.

01:04:26.590 --> 01:04:29.700
However, its life force
which lay dormant…

01:04:29.700 --> 01:04:33.930
is being awakened by the
powerful Tree of Ages.

01:04:34.770 --> 01:04:36.770
If the well is covered over,

01:04:36.770 --> 01:04:39.940
you will never be
able to pass through.

01:04:40.770 --> 01:04:44.490
Before that happens,
go back to your own time.

01:04:46.030 --> 01:04:48.430
But Inuyasha is…

01:04:48.430 --> 01:04:49.780
Go home!

01:04:50.660 --> 01:04:52.780
To your own time!

01:04:53.160 --> 01:04:56.160
You and Inuyasha will
never cross paths again!

01:04:56.660 --> 01:04:57.660
Go home!

01:05:15.020 --> 01:05:17.440
Never cross paths again…

01:05:17.810 --> 01:05:23.690
Nor can I, a dead woman
whose time has stopped.

01:05:28.610 --> 01:05:32.030
That girl broke my control…

01:05:35.290 --> 01:05:39.710
– The tree is dying!
– Stop, Gramps!

01:06:25.050 --> 01:06:33.180
Stop the falling snow…!

01:06:34.300 --> 01:06:36.240
If we pray,
will it go back to normal?

01:06:36.240 --> 01:06:37.370
It will!

01:06:37.370 --> 01:06:40.290
This is the sacred tree which
has protected this shrine!

01:06:40.290 --> 01:06:42.770
Our prayers are
sure to be answered!

01:06:42.770 --> 01:06:45.270
Now Sota, pray!

01:06:47.070 --> 01:06:54.610
– Stop the falling snow!
– Stop the falling snow!

01:06:55.330 --> 01:06:56.280
Sis!

01:06:56.280 --> 01:06:57.570
Kagome!

01:07:00.910 --> 01:07:01.930
Sis!

01:07:01.930 --> 01:07:05.250
Kagome… The sacred tree…!

01:07:09.170 --> 01:07:10.460
Inuyasha!

01:07:18.010 --> 01:07:19.180
Inuyash...

01:07:21.060 --> 01:07:23.060
My hands can't
touch him anymore.

01:07:24.100 --> 01:07:26.190
My voice won't
reach him anymore.

01:07:29.730 --> 01:07:33.790
I can't see Inuyasha…anymore!

01:07:33.790 --> 01:07:34.820
Sis!

01:07:35.660 --> 01:07:36.400
Sis?

01:07:36.400 --> 01:07:38.030
What's wrong, Kagome?

01:07:52.720 --> 01:07:55.970
Monk! You're pretty handsome.

01:07:56.550 --> 01:07:59.310
Makes me want to dig out
your heart and eat it!

01:08:30.960 --> 01:08:31.840
Kirara!

01:08:43.560 --> 01:08:44.560
Kirara!

01:08:44.560 --> 01:08:45.890
Kirara! Snap out of it!

01:08:57.070 --> 01:08:58.280
It's useless.

01:08:58.280 --> 01:09:01.120
She cannot hear
your voice anymore.

01:09:01.450 --> 01:09:03.520
A human and a demon…

01:09:03.520 --> 01:09:06.290
were never destined to
understand each other.

01:09:33.070 --> 01:09:35.070
You're Inuyasha's older brother…

01:09:35.900 --> 01:09:40.900
You must really hate her…
that girl named Kagome.

01:09:41.620 --> 01:09:45.160
Or are you just
testing her powers?

01:09:45.500 --> 01:09:48.420
I hate everything.

01:09:49.290 --> 01:09:53.340
I hate every living thing that
depends on the flow of time.

01:09:56.010 --> 01:09:57.130
As you please.

01:09:57.670 --> 01:10:00.970
However, I will be the
one to destroy Inuyasha.

01:10:10.100 --> 01:10:11.330
Lord Sesshomaru…

01:10:11.330 --> 01:10:15.280
is it wise to let
that woman live?

01:10:16.320 --> 01:10:19.260
Jaken, are you blind?

01:10:19.260 --> 01:10:21.140
That woman is dead.

01:10:21.140 --> 01:10:22.890
– Huh?! – What does that mean?

01:10:22.890 --> 01:10:24.700
She was moving.

01:10:25.040 --> 01:10:27.200
What does it mean,
Lord Sesshomaru?

01:10:27.200 --> 01:10:29.040
Silence, Rin!

01:10:29.040 --> 01:10:31.210
I'm not asking
you, Master Jaken!

01:10:31.210 --> 01:10:33.170
What?! You brazen child!

01:10:35.170 --> 01:10:37.630
Wait, Lord Sesshomaru!

01:10:44.060 --> 01:10:45.010
It's a lie!

01:10:45.010 --> 01:10:48.220
The Kagome who saved me
would never do such a thing!

01:10:48.220 --> 01:10:51.520
Kagome's eyes were
glazed over with evil.

01:10:51.850 --> 01:10:54.020
That was NOT our Kagome.

01:10:54.020 --> 01:10:56.840
Perhaps she's under the
same spell as Kirara.

01:10:56.840 --> 01:11:00.030
I have a bad premonition. We
must hurry to the sacred tree!

01:11:00.030 --> 01:11:02.670
You can at least stand
on your own feet!

01:11:02.670 --> 01:11:05.640
Be kind to an elderly
woman and an injured one!

01:11:05.640 --> 01:11:06.870
She's right!

01:11:06.870 --> 01:11:09.160
– Hurry, cow! – I'm a horse!

01:11:11.160 --> 01:11:12.160
This is—!

01:11:12.500 --> 01:11:13.330
I'm done for!

01:11:16.090 --> 01:11:17.170
What is that?!

01:11:22.800 --> 01:11:24.180
The well is covered!

01:11:24.180 --> 01:11:26.530
This is bad! The Tree of
Ages is going berserk!

01:11:26.530 --> 01:11:27.440
Berserk?

01:11:27.440 --> 01:11:30.580
Maybe that huge Tree of
Ages is calling out to it.

01:11:30.580 --> 01:11:32.960
This world will be swallowed
up if it's left unchecked…!

01:11:32.960 --> 01:11:34.310
Master Inuyasha!

01:11:40.190 --> 01:11:41.280
Master Inuyasha!

01:12:05.260 --> 01:12:06.740
Now then, Monk….

01:12:06.740 --> 01:12:09.030
Let's settle this.

01:12:09.030 --> 01:12:11.730
Your Wind Tunnel versus mine.

01:12:12.220 --> 01:12:14.100
We'll see who gets
sucked in first.

01:12:20.190 --> 01:12:21.230
Wind Tunnel!

01:13:16.290 --> 01:13:18.500
Stop this falling snow…

01:13:24.300 --> 01:13:27.170
Oh, Kagome! You're back?

01:13:28.010 --> 01:13:28.850
Welcome home.

01:13:28.850 --> 01:13:30.350
Mom, you took so long!

01:13:30.350 --> 01:13:31.550
Sorry!

01:13:35.310 --> 01:13:36.140
Mom…

01:13:37.060 --> 01:13:38.880
Thank you, Gramps.

01:13:38.880 --> 01:13:40.440
How is the sacred tree?

01:13:40.820 --> 01:13:43.710
Do not worry. Leave it to me!

01:13:43.710 --> 01:13:44.650
Yes.

01:13:45.320 --> 01:13:47.380
Put this over Gramps.

01:13:47.380 --> 01:13:48.200
'Kay!

01:13:49.320 --> 01:13:51.320
Hang in there, Gramps!

01:13:51.320 --> 01:13:52.030
Yes!

01:13:52.370 --> 01:13:56.250
Stop this falling snow…

01:13:57.000 --> 01:13:58.230
Mom…

01:13:58.230 --> 01:14:00.770
Maybe this is too light.

01:14:00.770 --> 01:14:02.330
I'll get a coat.

01:14:06.050 --> 01:14:06.880
Kagome?

01:14:10.010 --> 01:14:12.470
Mom,
is this tree that important?

01:14:12.970 --> 01:14:14.080
Yes.

01:14:14.080 --> 01:14:17.220
This tree holds
all our memories.

01:14:17.220 --> 01:14:18.390
Our memories?

01:14:19.350 --> 01:14:21.250
The time when Kagome was born.

01:14:21.250 --> 01:14:23.210
When you were born.

01:14:23.210 --> 01:14:25.210
When you entered school.

01:14:25.210 --> 01:14:27.450
When you took first
place at the school race.

01:14:27.450 --> 01:14:29.650
When you were in bed
with a high fever.

01:14:30.320 --> 01:14:32.700
Happy times and sad times.

01:14:32.700 --> 01:14:35.290
This tree lived
through it with us.

01:14:35.290 --> 01:14:38.000
It has always protected us.

01:14:40.250 --> 01:14:42.670
Even for me, this sacred tree…

01:14:46.380 --> 01:14:47.510
Inuyasha!

01:14:50.380 --> 01:14:53.390
This is my precious spot.

01:14:55.760 --> 01:14:57.290
– Huh? – What's the matter?

01:14:57.290 --> 01:14:59.360
The Sacred Jewel
shard is glowing.

01:14:59.360 --> 01:15:01.230
Sacred Jewel shard?

01:15:01.230 --> 01:15:02.860
As in Sacred Jewel
of the Four Souls?!

01:15:04.060 --> 01:15:05.900
I'm still connected…

01:15:07.400 --> 01:15:08.860
…to that world!

01:15:13.780 --> 01:15:17.460
I've never kept the Wind
Tunnel exposed for this long.

01:15:17.460 --> 01:15:19.410
I'm reaching my limit!

01:15:27.880 --> 01:15:31.460
Prepare to die, Monk!

01:15:41.430 --> 01:15:42.690
It's my victory!

01:15:57.450 --> 01:16:00.450
Lord Hyoga…!

01:16:17.390 --> 01:16:19.470
I will end up like that in time.

01:16:20.390 --> 01:16:21.540
My body…my bones…

01:16:21.540 --> 01:16:24.100
everything will
disappear into the void.

01:16:35.280 --> 01:16:37.160
You just don't get it, do you?

01:16:37.490 --> 01:16:39.540
Demons are born
to be controlled.

01:16:39.540 --> 01:16:42.320
And the best way is with power.

01:16:42.320 --> 01:16:46.420
No! My bond with Kirara
is not like that!

01:16:46.420 --> 01:16:47.750
So foolish!

01:16:48.090 --> 01:16:49.840
Still so naïve.

01:16:50.460 --> 01:16:51.630
Let's hurry and end it.

01:16:58.260 --> 01:16:59.120
Kirara!

01:16:59.120 --> 01:17:01.510
I'm not the only one in
pain, right?

01:17:17.450 --> 01:17:18.570
What's wrong, Kirara?

01:17:18.950 --> 01:17:20.240
Deliver the final blow!

01:17:27.420 --> 01:17:28.080
Kirara…

01:17:31.710 --> 01:17:33.050
Kirara! Stop!

01:17:39.720 --> 01:17:40.590
Kirara!

01:17:44.060 --> 01:17:45.560
My spell…!

01:17:46.600 --> 01:17:50.150
Kirara!
I knew you wanted to come back!

01:17:50.560 --> 01:17:52.560
I have no use for you anymore!

01:17:59.160 --> 01:18:00.740
Kirara! Hiraikotsu!

01:18:14.130 --> 01:18:15.460
Let's go, Kirara!

01:18:25.890 --> 01:18:26.680
We did it!

01:18:28.190 --> 01:18:30.560
Don't think it's
so easy to kill me.

01:18:38.610 --> 01:18:40.990
Lord Hyoga…!

01:18:41.530 --> 01:18:44.620
I can still fight…!

01:18:48.830 --> 01:18:50.580
Let's go, Kirara.

01:18:59.960 --> 01:19:01.610
Just a bit more.

01:19:01.610 --> 01:19:05.540
Just a few more souls
and I will be complete!

01:19:05.540 --> 01:19:08.520
So Old Myoga was right.

01:19:10.060 --> 01:19:12.520
Miroku!

01:19:13.690 --> 01:19:14.650
Sango!

01:19:16.190 --> 01:19:18.080
You got Kirara back?

01:19:18.080 --> 01:19:19.160
And you?

01:19:19.160 --> 01:19:20.720
I managed.

01:19:20.720 --> 01:19:23.480
But I overused my
Wind Tunnel a bit.

01:19:23.480 --> 01:19:26.320
The miasma has gotten stronger.

01:19:26.870 --> 01:19:29.140
Take Kirara and
make your escape.

01:19:29.140 --> 01:19:31.520
I will use my Wind
Tunnel and take care of…

01:19:31.520 --> 01:19:32.330
Miroku!

01:19:38.630 --> 01:19:40.300
That Menomaru!

01:19:40.300 --> 01:19:43.390
You intend to take my souls…

01:19:45.680 --> 01:19:46.970
Fox Fire!

01:19:51.680 --> 01:19:53.630
My Fox Magic isn't working.

01:19:53.630 --> 01:19:56.470
Kaede, what can I do?!

01:19:56.470 --> 01:20:00.050
To stop this tree which
is using evil to grow,

01:20:00.050 --> 01:20:05.700
only the sacred powers of
Kikyo or Kagome will work.

01:20:06.780 --> 01:20:07.830
Master Inuyasha!

01:20:08.240 --> 01:20:09.580
Master Inuyasha!

01:20:09.580 --> 01:20:11.350
Please open your eyes!

01:20:11.350 --> 01:20:13.830
It's the last wish I'll make!

01:20:26.090 --> 01:20:33.980
Snow…stop falling.

01:20:37.730 --> 01:20:39.650
I sucked too much!

01:20:42.820 --> 01:20:43.950
Kagome?

01:20:44.860 --> 01:20:48.490
I can feel him.
I can feel Inuyasha!

01:20:50.580 --> 01:20:51.790
Kagome?

01:20:54.750 --> 01:20:56.040
Is that you, Kagome?

01:20:56.540 --> 01:20:57.670
Inuyasha?!

01:20:58.590 --> 01:21:00.420
How is your wound?
Are you all right?

01:21:02.460 --> 01:21:04.050
This is nothing.

01:21:04.760 --> 01:21:06.970
But are you back home?

01:21:08.220 --> 01:21:10.760
I…came back…

01:21:12.560 --> 01:21:14.130
Got scared, didja?

01:21:14.130 --> 01:21:16.020
No! I…!

01:21:17.770 --> 01:21:18.770
I…

01:21:22.780 --> 01:21:23.780
What is it?

01:21:24.190 --> 01:21:26.820
No…never mind.

01:21:27.780 --> 01:21:30.120
Maybe I was running away.

01:21:31.950 --> 01:21:33.790
You're so silly.

01:21:34.250 --> 01:21:35.700
What do you mean, "silly"?!

01:21:41.790 --> 01:21:42.790
Inuyasha?

01:21:44.380 --> 01:21:47.050
You're right there…

01:21:48.760 --> 01:21:51.310
What're you worrying about?

01:21:51.810 --> 01:21:54.980
I…I'm so helpless.

01:21:55.720 --> 01:21:58.100
And I hurt you.

01:21:58.560 --> 01:22:01.480
I thought I shouldn't
stay by you.

01:22:01.820 --> 01:22:04.900
Quit babbling such nonsense.

01:22:04.900 --> 01:22:06.010
Inuyasha!

01:22:06.010 --> 01:22:08.530
Don't move!
You'll open your wounds.

01:22:20.250 --> 01:22:22.420
I need you.

01:22:22.880 --> 01:22:24.670
Haven't you realized that yet?!

01:22:34.850 --> 01:22:35.850
Thank you.

01:22:40.310 --> 01:22:41.440
Inuyasha…

01:22:43.320 --> 01:22:44.690
Let's go, Kagome!

01:22:46.860 --> 01:22:47.860
Yes!

01:23:02.920 --> 01:23:04.130
Oh boy…

01:23:08.670 --> 01:23:09.860
Inuyasha!

01:23:09.860 --> 01:23:11.340
I can't go back, Inuyasha!

01:23:11.840 --> 01:23:13.310
– K-Kagome! – Inuyasha!

01:23:13.310 --> 01:23:15.400
– Sis has gone bonkers!
– Can you hear me, Inuyasha?!

01:23:15.400 --> 01:23:16.760
Inuyasha!

01:23:16.760 --> 01:23:17.980
Is that you, Kagome?

01:23:17.980 --> 01:23:19.000
Inuyasha!

01:23:19.000 --> 01:23:21.020
The well is covered.
I can't go back.

01:23:21.560 --> 01:23:22.920
Don't give up, Kagome!

01:23:22.920 --> 01:23:24.540
Use the sacred arrow!

01:23:24.540 --> 01:23:26.610
Use that to tear
apart the roots!

01:23:26.980 --> 01:23:29.690
There's no such
thing in this world!

01:23:31.820 --> 01:23:32.740
There is!

01:23:33.240 --> 01:23:34.910
Gramps, give me one of these!

01:23:43.880 --> 01:23:44.620
Got it!

01:23:44.920 --> 01:23:47.000
Wait, Inuyasha! Be right there!

01:23:47.300 --> 01:23:48.920
Gramps, let me have this too!

01:23:51.880 --> 01:23:53.930
Cold, huh, Gramps?

01:23:54.300 --> 01:23:56.220
We'll have a hot pot tonight.

01:23:57.600 --> 01:23:58.830
Kagome?

01:23:58.830 --> 01:23:59.770
Mom!

01:24:00.770 --> 01:24:01.930
Don't forget this.

01:24:01.930 --> 01:24:02.730
Huh?

01:24:03.980 --> 01:24:04.940
Mom…

01:24:06.230 --> 01:24:08.940
Just be yourself. Okay?

01:24:11.320 --> 01:24:12.070
Okay!

01:24:13.110 --> 01:24:16.120
Inuyasha, how is your wound?

01:24:16.120 --> 01:24:17.850
Don't overdo it.

01:24:17.850 --> 01:24:21.330
Shaddup! I'm not built like you!

01:24:21.950 --> 01:24:24.080
If you don't want to be
killed, stay away!

01:24:27.960 --> 01:24:29.050
Go through!

01:24:36.640 --> 01:24:38.010
Here I…!

01:24:40.970 --> 01:24:41.970
What's this?!

01:24:43.980 --> 01:24:45.480
So much smoke!

01:24:46.900 --> 01:24:47.980
– Kagome! – Kagome!

01:24:49.360 --> 01:24:50.510
Oww!

01:24:50.510 --> 01:24:52.040
Kagome!

01:24:52.040 --> 01:24:53.210
Shippo!

01:24:53.210 --> 01:24:54.630
You're all right!

01:24:54.630 --> 01:24:55.780
Old Kaede!

01:24:56.700 --> 01:24:58.950
I'm so sorry about your hand.

01:24:59.370 --> 01:25:00.970
Don't worry about it.

01:25:00.970 --> 01:25:03.000
Hey, Kagome…!

01:25:06.000 --> 01:25:07.000
Inuyasha!

01:25:07.000 --> 01:25:10.000
Didja have to make
such a loud entrance?!

01:25:10.000 --> 01:25:13.070
You told me to use the arrow!

01:25:13.070 --> 01:25:14.990
I never told you to blow us up!

01:25:14.990 --> 01:25:16.410
Well, I didn't plan to!

01:25:16.410 --> 01:25:21.010
Stupid Inuyasha! She's back,
and they're fighting again?!

01:25:21.390 --> 01:25:24.270
Don't worry about them.
They're back to normal.

01:25:24.640 --> 01:25:25.730
Master Inuyasha!

01:25:26.560 --> 01:25:30.020
Hyoga is absorbing every
living soul in this world.

01:25:30.020 --> 01:25:32.720
This is no time for arguments!

01:25:32.720 --> 01:25:34.240
I know that!

01:25:35.280 --> 01:25:36.400
Let's go, Kagome!

01:25:36.910 --> 01:25:37.660
Okay!

01:26:06.560 --> 01:26:08.550
What's that glow?

01:26:08.550 --> 01:26:10.810
Hang on tight!

01:26:22.780 --> 01:26:24.120
What is it?

01:26:24.870 --> 01:26:26.900
Darn! We're too late!

01:26:26.900 --> 01:26:28.100
Myoga?!

01:26:28.100 --> 01:26:29.750
You're not running away?

01:26:30.080 --> 01:26:32.380
I act when I must!

01:26:33.090 --> 01:26:35.090
I misjudged you, Old Myoga!

01:27:06.120 --> 01:27:08.360
He's gotten so big!

01:27:08.360 --> 01:27:11.460
Hah! That's all he is!

01:27:15.460 --> 01:27:18.050
Scaring us won't work!

01:27:23.050 --> 01:27:24.470
Inuyasha! Are you okay?!

01:27:24.470 --> 01:27:26.100
Don't waste your time worrying.

01:27:26.100 --> 01:27:28.770
Half-demon, you're still alive?

01:27:28.770 --> 01:27:29.920
Shaddup!

01:27:29.920 --> 01:27:32.020
It's payback time!

01:27:33.980 --> 01:27:35.400
The time has come!

01:27:49.870 --> 01:27:51.790
What are those demons?!

01:27:52.290 --> 01:27:54.790
They are demons
from the Continent.

01:27:55.210 --> 01:27:57.110
The only way to win…

01:27:57.110 --> 01:28:00.590
is to combine the powers of
Tetsusaiga and Kagome's arrow.

01:28:01.170 --> 01:28:03.370
Tetsusaiga and Kagome's arrow?

01:28:03.370 --> 01:28:05.220
Good luck to you!

01:28:06.010 --> 01:28:07.260
You're running away, after all?!

01:28:07.260 --> 01:28:09.180
My servants!

01:28:09.180 --> 01:28:11.180
Devour this world!

01:28:14.560 --> 01:28:16.190
Get a taste of my Tetsusaiga!

01:28:21.030 --> 01:28:21.760
He did it!

01:28:21.760 --> 01:28:23.200
Inuyasha, you're so strong!

01:28:24.910 --> 01:28:27.280
Damn! They're not decreasing!

01:28:27.280 --> 01:28:29.030
There are too many of them!

01:28:31.790 --> 01:28:33.120
They're coming this way!

01:28:33.960 --> 01:28:35.460
Don't come! Stupid!

01:28:38.130 --> 01:28:39.420
Kagome! Shippo!

01:28:40.790 --> 01:28:42.210
Hiraikotsu!

01:28:45.760 --> 01:28:46.640
Sango!

01:28:46.640 --> 01:28:47.890
Miroku, too!

01:28:49.350 --> 01:28:50.390
Kagome!

01:28:51.060 --> 01:28:53.220
You're all okay! I'm so glad!

01:28:53.220 --> 01:28:55.020
Nice to see you safe, too!

01:28:55.520 --> 01:28:57.270
Don't just stand there!

01:29:00.070 --> 01:29:01.110
Wind Tunnel!

01:29:04.240 --> 01:29:06.220
Leave the small fry to me!
Hurry!

01:29:06.220 --> 01:29:07.660
Thank you, Miroku!

01:29:08.240 --> 01:29:09.350
Do your best!

01:29:09.350 --> 01:29:12.410
If you die,
I'll never forget you!

01:29:12.410 --> 01:29:13.390
Huh?

01:29:13.390 --> 01:29:15.660
Don't say such a thing!

01:29:15.660 --> 01:29:18.030
It's obvious. We're gonna win!

01:29:18.030 --> 01:29:19.310
Win?

01:29:19.310 --> 01:29:24.210
A half-demon like
you defeat me?!

01:29:24.210 --> 01:29:25.730
Shaddup!

01:29:25.730 --> 01:29:27.170
I'll take you on!

01:29:27.170 --> 01:29:28.090
Inuyasha!

01:29:29.260 --> 01:29:30.390
Kagome, be careful!

01:29:31.060 --> 01:29:33.010
I'll be fine.
Inuyasha's with me!

01:29:42.400 --> 01:29:43.530
Inuyasha! Get up!

01:29:44.200 --> 01:29:45.950
A half-demon coupled with a

01:29:45.950 --> 01:29:48.150
mortal girl?
Don't make me laugh!

01:29:48.700 --> 01:29:51.370
What's wrong with
me being with him?

01:29:51.910 --> 01:29:56.390
Hah! Your tribe was turned
into boneless weaklings…

01:29:56.390 --> 01:29:59.850
by cavorting with disgusting
creatures called humans.

01:29:59.850 --> 01:30:03.750
Damn! His aura is too strong
and it's sucking up my energy.

01:30:04.220 --> 01:30:05.530
Kagome, shoot!

01:30:05.530 --> 01:30:06.300
Huh?

01:30:07.090 --> 01:30:07.990
Shoot!

01:30:07.990 --> 01:30:09.410
Aim for his body!

01:30:09.410 --> 01:30:10.300
All right!

01:30:11.180 --> 01:30:13.310
I wonder if this
little arrow will work?

01:30:21.940 --> 01:30:24.730
I see it… The spot where
the swirling air collides!

01:30:24.730 --> 01:30:24.750
Wind Scar!
I see it… The spot where
the swirling air collides!

01:30:24.750 --> 01:30:26.320
Wind Scar!

01:30:37.370 --> 01:30:39.540
I just scratched the surface!

01:30:45.460 --> 01:30:47.840
Don't get so cocky!

01:30:48.880 --> 01:30:51.340
Feel my power!

01:30:51.680 --> 01:30:52.930
Kagome! Run!

01:31:01.350 --> 01:31:02.840
Such an intense demonic aura!

01:31:02.840 --> 01:31:04.360
Is there such a thing?

01:31:05.230 --> 01:31:07.470
He's really mad.

01:31:07.470 --> 01:31:09.090
We can win, Kagome.

01:31:09.090 --> 01:31:09.930
Huh?

01:31:09.930 --> 01:31:12.830
Next time, I'll use the Backlash
Wave to send it back at him.

01:31:13.370 --> 01:31:14.370
Amazing!

01:31:14.370 --> 01:31:17.870
Do you think that, maybe,
we're in way over our heads?

01:31:18.210 --> 01:31:19.140
Shall we make a run for it?

01:31:19.140 --> 01:31:19.920
Huh?

01:31:23.340 --> 01:31:24.290
Hiraikotsu!

01:31:36.390 --> 01:31:38.390
You've witnessed my power…

01:31:38.390 --> 01:31:40.250
and you still want to defy me?

01:31:40.250 --> 01:31:41.350
I'm impressed.

01:31:41.350 --> 01:31:44.460
So you still can move!
Bring it on!

01:31:44.460 --> 01:31:47.560
Your mouth seems to be your
only weapon, half-demon.

01:31:47.560 --> 01:31:50.300
Well, you'll soon see!

01:31:50.300 --> 01:31:51.220
Inuyasha!

01:31:51.220 --> 01:31:53.990
His demonic aura centers around
the mark on his forehead.

01:31:54.330 --> 01:31:55.410
Can you aim for it?

01:31:55.410 --> 01:31:56.870
I'll try.

01:31:58.750 --> 01:32:00.410
Please reach!

01:32:07.420 --> 01:32:09.050
There!

01:32:09.460 --> 01:32:10.420
Fool!

01:32:10.930 --> 01:32:13.970
As if I'd fall for your
trick a second time!

01:32:18.470 --> 01:32:19.430
I missed!

01:32:22.680 --> 01:32:23.520
What—?!

01:32:32.570 --> 01:32:33.450
Huh?

01:32:34.160 --> 01:32:36.950
Die, wench!

01:32:38.450 --> 01:32:39.950
Damn! Kagome!

01:32:45.040 --> 01:32:45.870
Are you all right?

01:32:45.870 --> 01:32:46.880
Thank you!

01:32:47.460 --> 01:32:48.280
Can you go on?

01:32:48.280 --> 01:32:50.860
Yes, take me to Inuyasha!

01:32:50.860 --> 01:32:51.760
All right.

01:32:52.090 --> 01:32:52.880
Kirara!

01:32:55.840 --> 01:32:57.080
Inuyasha!

01:32:57.080 --> 01:32:58.180
Miroku!

01:32:58.180 --> 01:33:00.040
I've taken care
of the small fry.

01:33:00.040 --> 01:33:01.770
I chased three away.

01:33:02.100 --> 01:33:02.830
Good job!

01:33:02.830 --> 01:33:04.430
– Inuyasha! – Huh?

01:33:06.860 --> 01:33:07.940
Stupid!

01:33:10.480 --> 01:33:11.520
Don't be reckless!

01:33:11.820 --> 01:33:15.010
I knew you'd catch me.

01:33:15.010 --> 01:33:17.740
You're not baggage!

01:33:18.490 --> 01:33:19.330
Sango!

01:33:20.540 --> 01:33:21.980
Don't be shy!

01:33:21.980 --> 01:33:24.290
Come into my arms!

01:33:24.790 --> 01:33:25.500
Stupid!

01:33:29.590 --> 01:33:30.380
He's coming!

01:33:30.800 --> 01:33:33.570
Kagome, aim for the mark again.

01:33:33.570 --> 01:33:36.980
But the aura is too strong
and my arrow won't reach.

01:33:36.980 --> 01:33:38.770
Quit making excuses!

01:33:38.770 --> 01:33:41.510
Just be manly as
usual and shoot!

01:33:41.510 --> 01:33:42.640
Manly?

01:33:42.980 --> 01:33:45.190
I'll use your arrow to
relay my Backlash Wave!

01:33:45.520 --> 01:33:46.770
Trust me and shoot!

01:33:48.940 --> 01:33:49.760
Uh-huh!

01:33:49.760 --> 01:33:51.520
Playtime is over!

01:33:51.520 --> 01:33:53.530
I'll send you all to hell!

01:34:04.540 --> 01:34:06.800
Hey! Don't waste time! Hurry!

01:34:06.800 --> 01:34:10.290
I know! Trust me, too!

01:34:16.960 --> 01:34:18.220
Kagome!

01:34:18.550 --> 01:34:19.430
Kagome!

01:34:23.020 --> 01:34:24.480
Go!

01:34:29.440 --> 01:34:30.590
I'll show you!

01:34:30.590 --> 01:34:33.160
This power of ours
that you laughed at!

01:34:33.160 --> 01:34:34.210
Take this!

01:34:34.210 --> 01:34:36.110
Backlash Wave!

01:34:41.570 --> 01:34:42.610
What?!

01:34:48.370 --> 01:34:51.580
Why you—! Half-demon!

01:35:01.100 --> 01:35:02.050
We did it!

01:35:04.220 --> 01:35:07.600
How could a human
and a half-demon…!

01:35:10.190 --> 01:35:11.360
It's over.

01:35:19.400 --> 01:35:20.780
Hurry, everyone!

01:35:25.620 --> 01:35:27.620
The Tree of Ages is crumbling.

01:35:28.580 --> 01:35:31.770
It grew from Hyoga's
demonic power.

01:35:31.770 --> 01:35:34.580
It's only natural that
it return to dust.

01:35:49.100 --> 01:35:49.970
Are you hurt?

01:35:49.970 --> 01:35:52.650
No, I'm fine. What about you?

01:35:53.230 --> 01:35:55.650
I mean…your stomach wound.

01:35:55.650 --> 01:35:57.690
Hah! It's nothing!

01:35:59.570 --> 01:36:00.820
Thank you, Inuyasha.

01:36:01.240 --> 01:36:02.070
Huh?

01:36:02.450 --> 01:36:04.070
Oh, nothing.

01:36:04.370 --> 01:36:05.640
What's with you?

01:36:05.640 --> 01:36:07.130
Master Inuyasha!

01:36:07.130 --> 01:36:08.490
Old Myoga!

01:36:08.490 --> 01:36:09.680
That was brilliant!

01:36:09.680 --> 01:36:13.550
You used the tactic I
precisely prescribed.

01:36:13.550 --> 01:36:15.210
You are amazing,
Master Inuyasha!

01:36:15.540 --> 01:36:18.670
Hah! You ran off at
the most critical time.

01:36:18.670 --> 01:36:21.950
Huh? But if he knows
how you defeated Hyoga…

01:36:21.950 --> 01:36:23.280
Were you close by?

01:36:23.280 --> 01:36:24.660
Of course!

01:36:24.660 --> 01:36:26.700
I would never abandon
my Master Inuyasha.

01:36:26.700 --> 01:36:28.450
– You always do. – You do.

01:36:28.450 --> 01:36:29.750
– Never mind! – I DO mind!

01:36:29.750 --> 01:36:31.440
Master Inuyasha!

01:36:32.020 --> 01:36:34.150
Oww! Oww! I'm flying–!

01:39:06.510 --> 01:39:07.510
It's so pretty.

01:39:07.880 --> 01:39:09.090
Like snow.

01:39:09.840 --> 01:39:10.840
Snow…

01:39:11.840 --> 01:39:13.940
That time was so strange.

01:39:13.940 --> 01:39:17.120
I could hear your voice
from within the sacred tree.

01:39:17.120 --> 01:39:19.560
You seemed so close.

01:39:19.560 --> 01:39:21.350
I was there.

01:39:21.770 --> 01:39:26.400
You looked so exhausted,
I was worried.

01:39:28.280 --> 01:39:30.860
Say… Shall I make lunches again?

01:39:30.860 --> 01:39:35.040
Huh? Then include that thing.
That yellow stuff.

01:39:35.490 --> 01:39:37.010
My egg omelet?

01:39:37.010 --> 01:39:39.000
Not egg…

01:39:39.000 --> 01:39:40.640
It was crunchy.

01:39:40.640 --> 01:39:44.080
Huh?
You mean the pickled radish?

01:39:44.080 --> 01:39:46.800
Yeah, that was the only
thing worth eating!

01:39:48.260 --> 01:39:49.090
Oops!

01:39:50.090 --> 01:39:51.320
Inuyasha…

01:39:51.320 --> 01:39:52.840
SIT!
